31933::$$$message_0251_0000_0000$$$::We arrive at the center of Miyama.[lr]::
31934::$$$message_0251_0000_0001$$$::In the direction of Shinto, I can see the illuminated bridge and the Shinto skyline in the distance.::
31935::$$$message_0251_0001_0000$$$::"There's nothing abnormal here. We could keep patrolling Miyama or head to Shinto. I'll leave it up to you, Shirou."[lr]::
31936::$$$message_0251_0001_0001$$$::Eventually, the night will end.[lr]::
31937::$$$message_0251_0001_0002$$$::The others will get worried if we come home too late, and I'd like to avoid walking around aimlessly.::
31938::$$$message_0251_0002_0000$$$::"Let me think. Let's do a quick survey of Miyama and then go check out Shinto."[lr]::
31939::$$$message_0251_0002_0001$$$::Eventually, the night will end.[lr]::
31940::$$$message_0251_0002_0002$$$::I'd love to keep walking around with Saber, but I should consider how to close this out.dˆK